OL,3,GNEWSAGiant sun installation starts
OL,4,Acathedral celebration
OL,5,
OL,6,FA giant illuminated sun installation
OL,7,Fhas been put on display in Derby
OL,8,FCathedral to launch a centenary
OL,9,Fcelebration of the local diocese.
OL,11,FThe sculpture, created by artist Luke
OL,12,FJerram, is named after the Greek god of
OL,13,Fthe sun, Helios, and has been scaled so
OL,14,Feach centimetre represents 2,000km
OL,15,F(1,242 miles) of the star's surface.
OL,17,FHelios, which has previously lit up
OL,18,FKedleston Hall, is on display from
OL,19,FTuesday until 31 October as part of a
OL,20,Fwider programme of events celebrating
OL,21,Fthe 100th anniversary of the Diocese of
OL,22,FDerby.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
