OL,3,GNEWSAGiant sun installation starts
OL,4,Acathedral celebration
OL,5,
OL,6,FVery Rev Dr Peter Robinson, Dean of
OL,7,FDerby, said: "Helios is a spectacular
OL,8,Fway to begin our centenary year,
OL,9,Finviting people to experience Derby
OL,10,FCathedral from a new perspective."
